## Maintaining this file

When I state a rule about future behaviour or correct an output, the `learn` skill decides where it
goes (a hook, the skill that owns the workflow, a reference file, a path rule, this file only if
nothing would prompt a lookup, memory for preferences and project state) and logs a dated entry in
`.claude/rules-changelog.md`. Rules are judgement with the reason attached. The repository holds every
rule, memory only live state. Under 200 lines: past that, something moves out before anything comes
in.
